1602
01:23:48.388 --> 01:23:49.848
That should all sound very reasonable.

1603
01:23:50.988 --> 01:23:54.938
However, I've had conversations with multiple high-profile reconfiguration

1604
01:23:54.988 --> 01:23:58.648
advocates who tell me that we should not bring this issue to a vote

1605
01:23:58.848 --> 01:24:01.028
because voters are prejudiced or uninformed.

1606
01:24:02.158 --> 01:24:04.368
