1620
01:24:57.248 --> 01:25:00.548
Yet under reconfiguration, South Portland students would transition schools five

1621
01:25:00.628 --> 01:25:01.748
times in their first 10 years.

1622
01:25:03.328 --> 01:25:05.388
And it is not free because it is literally not free.

1623
