1625
01:25:13.628 --> 01:25:16.408
Most strangely of all, we would be paying for something that we already have.

1626
01:25:17.708 --> 01:25:21.368
All South Portland students already learn together in fifth, sixth,

1627
01:25:21.448 --> 01:25:24.618
seventh, eighth, ninth, tenth, eleventh, and twelfth grades.

1628
01:25:26.548 --> 01:25:28.948
The benefits, to the extent that they are real, are built into the

1629
01:25:28.968 --> 01:25:32.676
system.Whatever incremental theoretical gains

1630
01:25:32.736 --> 01:25:36.236
cannot be worth the immense cost to the community, walkability, and budget.

1631
01:25:37.396 --> 01:25:37.955
